{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5a65c83c-a07e-49c2-85aa-a08699e71f69",
    "name": "CNF Create DI - Standard SAP Service - Depot",
    "description": "Create DI for C&F depots through SAP's standard API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2 deep insert.\n\nProven in QS4/700 on 17 Sep 2026 for all three depot flows with the same five-field request:\n- Depot Trade: sales order type ZTRD -> delivery type ZNP\n- Depot Non-trade: sales order type ZNTR -> delivery type ZLF\n- Depot to depot STO -> delivery type ZNL\n\nStandard SAP refuses a DI (HTTP 400, nothing created) when:\n- the quantity is above the open order quantity (VL/363)\n- the order failed credit check (VL/060)\n- the order has a delivery block\n- the order is incomplete, e.g. SPI missing on the order (VL/096)\n\nKnown gap: a billing block on the order does NOT stop the DI today. A BAdI check is planned.\n\nSafety controls in this collection:\n- The POST is blocked unless confirmCreateDI=YES. The switch resets to NO before sending, so every POST needs a fresh YES.\n- The POST is blocked if the CSRF token or any payload variable is empty.\n- deliveryDocument is cleared before the POST, so a failed POST can never be followed by a readback of an older delivery.\n- expectedOutcome=CREATE expects 201 and a delivery number; expectedOutcome=REJECT expects 400 and, if expectedErrorCode is set, that SAP error code.\n\nDocuments already used in testing - do not reuse: orders 5284403, 5284692, 5284664, 5284465, 5284415, 5284812; STO 5600083801; deliveries 9004953534, 9004953537, 9004953538, 9004953540.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{sap-user}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{sap-pass}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base",
      "value": "{{host}}/sap/opu/odata/sap"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Connectivity",
      "description": "Read-only metadata check for the standard delivery service.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00.1 GET Delivery service metadata",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Metadata returned 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Response is EDMX metadata', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('edmx:Edmx'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/xml"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2/$metadata?sap-client={{sap-client}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2",
                "$metadata"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sap-client",
                  "value": "{{sap-client}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "HTTP 200 with EDMX metadata confirms authentication and routing. The ;v=2 suffix is mandatory; without it Gateway returns 403 /IWFND/MED/170."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Create DI - depot Trade, Non-trade or STO",
      "description": "Run 01.1, set the order variables and expectedOutcome, set confirmCreateDI=YES, run 01.2 once. For a created DI, run 01.3 and 01.4. The create response carries an empty item array, so the readbacks are required before the DI counts as verified.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01.1 GET CSRF token - Delivery service",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const token = pm.response.headers.get('x-csrf-token');",
                  "pm.test('Token fetch returned 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('SAP returned a CSRF token', () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a('string').and.not.eql('Required'));",
                  "if (token && token !== 'Required') pm.environment.set('csrf', token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-csrf-token",
                "value": "Fetch"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2/?sap-client={{sap-client}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2",
                ""
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sap-client",
                  "value": "{{sap-client}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fetches the CSRF token and the SAP session cookies it is bound to. Keep Postman's cookie jar enabled."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "01.2 POST Create DI - REAL WRITE",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const confirmation = pm.environment.get('confirmCreateDI');",
                  "pm.environment.set('confirmCreateDI', 'NO');",
                  "if (confirmation !== 'YES') {",
                  "  throw new Error('Create DI blocked. Set confirmCreateDI=YES only after checking the order in VA03/ME23N. The switch resets to NO on every attempt.');",
                  "}",
                  "const required = ['csrf', 'shippingPoint', 'referenceSDDocument', 'referenceSDDocumentItem', 'actualDeliveryQuantity', 'deliveryQuantityUnit'];",
                  "const missing = required.filter((key) => !pm.environment.get(key));",
                  "if (missing.length) {",
                  "  throw new Error('Create DI blocked. Missing environment variables: ' + missing.join(', '));",
                  "}",
                  "const outcome = (pm.environment.get('expectedOutcome') || 'CREATE').toUpperCase();",
                  "if (!['CREATE', 'REJECT'].includes(outcome)) {",
                  "  throw new Error('expectedOutcome must be CREATE or REJECT.');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.environment.set('deliveryDocument', '');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const outcome = (pm.environment.get('expectedOutcome') || 'CREATE').toUpperCase();",
                  "let body = {};",
                  "try { body = pm.response.json(); } catch (error) { console.warn('Response was not JSON. Review it manually.'); }",
                  "if (outcome === 'CREATE') {",
                  "  pm.test('Create DI returned 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "  const delivery = body?.d?.DeliveryDocument;",
                  "  pm.test('SAP returned a delivery document number', () => pm.expect(delivery).to.match(/^\\d+$/));",
                  "  if (delivery) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('deliveryDocument', delivery);",
                  "    console.log('Created delivery:', delivery, 'type', body.d.DeliveryDocumentType);",
                  "  }",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('SAP refused the DI with 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "  const code = body?.error?.code;",
                  "  const message = body?.error?.message?.value;",
                  "  console.log('SAP error:', code, message);",
                  "  const expected = pm.environment.get('expectedErrorCode');",
                  "  if (expected) {",
                  "    pm.test('SAP error code is ' + expected, () => pm.expect(code).to.eql(expected));",
                  "  }",
                  "  pm.test('No delivery number returned', () => pm.expect(body?.d?.DeliveryDocument).to.be.undefined);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-csrf-token",
                "value": "{{csrf}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ShippingPoint\": \"{{shippingPoint}}\",\n  \"to_DeliveryDocumentItem\": [\n    {\n      \"ReferenceSDDocument\": \"{{referenceSDDocument}}\",\n      \"ReferenceSDDocumentItem\": \"{{referenceSDDocumentItem}}\",\n      \"ActualDeliveryQuantity\": \"{{actualDeliveryQuantity}}\",\n      \"DeliveryQuantityUnit\": \"{{deliveryQuantityUnit}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2/A_OutbDeliveryHeader?sap-client={{sap-client}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2",
                "A_OutbDeliveryHeader"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sap-client",
                  "value": "{{sap-client}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "REAL SAP WRITE when SAP accepts the request.\n\nThe same request works for all three depot flows:\n- Trade or Non-trade: referenceSDDocument = sales order, item e.g. 000010, shippingPoint = the order item's shipping point (the depot)\n- STO: referenceSDDocument = STO number, item e.g. 000010, shippingPoint = the supplying depot's shipping point\n\nSAP derives delivery type, route, partners, Incoterm and SPI from the order. Do not send ReferenceSDDocumentCategory; SAP marks it not creatable.\n\nDo not resend after a timeout or lost response. Check the order's document flow (VA03 / ME23N) for a new delivery first."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "01.3 GET Created DI header and partners - readback",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('deliveryDocument')) {",
                  "  throw new Error('No deliveryDocument from the last POST. Nothing to read back.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Delivery header readback returned 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const header = pm.response.json()?.d ?? {};",
                  "pm.test('Readback matches the created delivery', () => pm.expect(header.DeliveryDocument).to.eql(pm.environment.get('deliveryDocument')));",
                  "pm.test('Shipping point matches the request', () => pm.expect(header.ShippingPoint).to.eql(pm.environment.get('shippingPoint')));",
                  "console.log('Delivery type:', header.DeliveryDocumentType, '| SPI:', header.SpecialProcessingCode, '| Incoterm:', header.IncotermsClassification);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2/A_OutbDeliveryHeader('{{deliveryDocument}}')?$expand=to_DeliveryDocumentPartner&$format=json&sap-client={{sap-client}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2",
                "A_OutbDeliveryHeader('{{deliveryDocument}}')"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "$expand",
                  "value": "to_DeliveryDocumentPartner"
                },
                {
                  "key": "$format",
                  "value": "json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sap-client",
                  "value": "{{sap-client}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Independent readback of the created delivery header and partners. Note: OData partner codes are English: SP = sold-to, SH = ship-to. Confirm in VL03N as well."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "01.4 GET Created DI items - readback",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('deliveryDocument')) {",
                  "  throw new Error('No deliveryDocument from the last POST. Nothing to read back.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unpad = (value) => String(value ?? '').replace(/^0+/, '');",
                  "pm.test('Delivery item readback returned 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const items = pm.response.json()?.d?.results ?? [];",
                  "pm.test('Created delivery has at least one item', () => pm.expect(items.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "const item = items.find((row) => unpad(row.ReferenceSDDocument) === unpad(pm.environment.get('referenceSDDocument')) && unpad(row.ReferenceSDDocumentItem) === unpad(pm.environment.get('referenceSDDocumentItem')));",
                  "pm.test('An item references the requested order item', () => pm.expect(item).to.not.be.undefined);",
                  "if (item) {",
                  "  pm.test('Delivered quantity matches the request', () => pm.expect(Number(item.ActualDeliveryQuantity)).to.eql(Number(pm.environment.get('actualDeliveryQuantity'))));",
                  "  pm.test('Delivery unit matches the request', () => pm.expect(item.DeliveryQuantityUnit).to.eql(pm.environment.get('deliveryQuantityUnit')));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2/A_OutbDeliveryItem?$filter=DeliveryDocument%20eq%20'{{deliveryDocument}}'&$format=json&sap-client={{sap-client}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2",
                "A_OutbDeliveryItem"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "$filter",
                  "value": "DeliveryDocument%20eq%20'{{deliveryDocument}}'"
                },
                {
                  "key": "$format",
                  "value": "json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sap-client",
                  "value": "{{sap-client}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reads only the items of the delivery just created and checks the order item, quantity and unit."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
